# 1965 Howard Bulldogs football team

The 1965 Howard Bulldogs football team represented Howard College—now known as Samford University—as an independent during the 1965 NCAA College Division football season. Led by Bubba Scott in his third and final season as head coach, the Bulldogs compiled a record of 4–6. Howard played home games at Seibert Stadium in Homewood, Alabama.
